<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR OWN SPARK</view><view class="title">我的 Spark</view>
  <view wx:if="!configured" class="message">微信版正在准备，暂未开放报名。你仍可浏览社区公开榜单。</view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="!user"><view class="section-title">用微信账号连接</view><view class="muted">账号用于区分身份，昵称由你本人确认。仅浏览榜单不需要报名。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login" disabled="{{!configured||busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">微信登录</button></view>
  <block wx:else><view class="card"><view class="section-title">微信登录账号已连接</view><view class="muted">展示昵称</view><input type="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="nickname" placeholder="选择或填写展示昵称" maxlength="40"/><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}" color="#647b40"/><text>我自愿公开昵称、每日模型与 Token 汇总，且有权分享这个实例的整体统计。</text></label></checkbox-group><view class="link small" bindtap="privacy">阅读公开与退出说明 ↗</view><button class="primary" bindtap="enroll" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{user.consent_public?'保存昵称':'确认自愿参加'}}</button></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="user.consent_public"><view class="section-title">绑定本地上报器</view><view class="muted">在能访问 sparkDash 的电脑克隆项目。先复制命令并替换本地地址，运行后再粘贴绑定码。地址和 sparkDash 令牌留在本机。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="copyCommand">复制本机绑定命令</button><button class="primary" bindtap="pair" disabled="{{busy}}">生成一次性绑定码</button><view wx:if="pairingCode" class="pair"><text class="mono" selectable>{{pairingCode}}</text><view class="muted small">10 分钟有效，仅限一次。不要分享给他人；离开此页会隐藏。</view><button size="mini" bindtap="copyCode">复制绑定码</button></view><view class="muted small">已授权 {{user.device_count}} 台设备</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="revoke" disabled="{{busy}}">撤销所有设备</button></view>
  <view class="card"><button wx:if="user.consent_public" class="secondary" bindtap="leave" disabled="{{busy}}">退出公开榜单</button><button bindtap="logout">退出当前微信登录</button></view></block>
  <view class="muted small">微信登录确认账号身份，不代表展示昵称经过实名认证，也不证明实例统计只属于你个人。</view>
</view>
